remote_xform[1]=local_xform[1];
```

} else if (setrot) {

```
remote_xform[0]=local_xform[0].normalized() * remote_xform[0].length();
remote_xform[1]=local_xform[1].normalized() * remote_xform[1].length();
```

} else if (restscale) {

   remote_xform[0]=remote_xform[0].normalized() \* local_xform[0].length();
